OL,3,GNEWSAFlight delays and cancellations at
OL,4,Anumber of UK airports due to air
OL,5,Atraffic control issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FAirports across the UK are seeing
OL,8,Fflight delays and cancellations due to
OL,9,Fan issue with air traffic control
OL,11,FNats says the issue is with its "flight
OL,12,Fprocessing system" and that "recovery
OL,13,Fwill take some time"
OL,15,FHeathrow, Gatwick and East Midlands
OL,16,Fairports are affected, with Manchester
OL,17,Fairport warning of potential delays,
OL,18,Fwrites our correspondent
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
