OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F408A1788884766
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFlight delays and cancellations at
OL,4,Anumber of UK airports due to air
OL,5,Atraffic control issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FAbout 200 flights are thought to have
OL,8,Fbeen cancelled already, according to
OL,9,Fflight tracking website Flightradar24,
OL,10,Fwith the number expected to rise
OL,12,F"Technicians have identified the issue
OL,13,Fand are fixing it as we speak,"
OL,14,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander
OL,15,Fsays in a statement on X
OL,17,FEasyJet and British Airways are among
OL,18,Fthe airlines reporting issues, with
OL,19,FRyanair saying 65,000 of its passengers
OL,20,Fhave been delayed by up to eight hours
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
